    "body": "IDL does not throw for enums passed to setters. It only does so for methods and constructors.\r\n\r\n@jcjones could you elaborate a bit on https://github.com/w3c/webauthn/issues/1376? It's a little surprising to see specifications deviate from the platform norms.",
