    "created_at": "2020-06-16T08:09:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-16T08:09:08Z",
    "body": "Thanks, I can see how this might be useful for certain dictionaries, although normally I'd expect the caller to do some kind of feature testing. For IDL we should probably wait until more use cases show up around methods/dictionaries.",
